      "source": "The enity that is used in these examples is a <code>Person</code> entity.\nThis entity has a <code>birthDate</code> and an <code>age</code> property.\nWhereas the birthdate is fix, the age depends on the time when a query is issued and needs to be calculated dynamically.",
      "translation": "这些示例中使用的实体是 `<code>Person</code>` 实体。  \n该实体具有 `<code>birthDate</code>` 和 `<code>age</code>` 属性。  \n其中，出生日期是固定的，而年龄取决于查询发出的时间，需要动态计算。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Elasticsearch supports scripted fields and runtime fields.\nPlease refer to the Elasticsearch documentation about scripting (<a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/modules-scripting.html\">www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/modules-scripting.html</a>) and runtime fields (<a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.9/runtime.html\">www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.9/runtime.html</a>) for detailed information about this.\nIn the context of Spring Data Elasticsearch you can use",
      "translation": "Spring Data Elasticsearch 支持脚本字段和运行时字段。有关此功能的详细信息，请参阅 Elasticsearch 文档中关于脚本（<a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/modules-scripting.html\">www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/modules-scripting.html</a>）和运行时字段（<a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.9/runtime.html\">www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.9/runtime.html</a>）的部分。在 Spring Data Elasticsearch 的上下文中，您可以使用",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the <code>age</code> property is annotated with <code>@ScriptedField</code>.\nThis inhibits the writing of a corresponding entry in the index mapping and marks the property as a target to put a calculated field from a search response.",
      "translation": "请注意，`age` 属性已标注了 `@ScriptedField`。这会阻止在索引映射中写入相应的条目，并将该属性标记为搜索响应中计算字段的放置目标。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The service class has a repository injected and an <code>ElasticsearchOperations</code> instance to show several ways of populating and using the <code>age</code> property.\nWe show the code split up in different pieces to put the explanations in",
      "translation": "服务类中注入了仓储，并包含一个 `<code>ElasticsearchOperations` 实例，以展示多种填充和使用 `<code>age` 属性的方法。我们将代码拆分为不同的部分，以便插入相应的解释说明。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In addition to define a runtime fields on a query, they can also be defined in the index by setting the <code>runtimeFieldsPath</code> property of the <code>@Mapping</code> annotation to point to a JSON file that contains the runtime field definitions.",
      "translation": "除了可以在查询中定义运行时字段外，还可以通过将 `@Mapping` 注解的 `<code>runtimeFieldsPath</code>` 属性设置为指向包含运行时字段定义的 JSON 文件，在索引中定义这些字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "scripted fields that are used to return fields that are calculated on the result documents and added to the returned document.",
      "translation": "用于在结果文档上计算字段并将其添加到返回文档中的脚本字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "runtime fields that are calculated on the stored documents and can be used in a query and/or be returned in the search result.",
      "translation": "在存储文档上计算并可用于查询和/或在搜索结果中返回的运行时字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following code snippets will show what you can do (these show imperative code, but the reactive implementation works similar).",
      "translation": "以下代码片段将展示您可以实现的功能（这些示例展示了命令式代码，但响应式实现的工作原理类似）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The repository used in this example:",
      "translation": "本示例中使用的仓库：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The next piece shows how to use a scripted field to calculate and return the age of the persons.\nScripted fields can only add something to the returned data, the age cannot be used in the query (see runtime fields for that).",
      "translation": "下一部分展示了如何使用脚本字段计算并返回人员的年龄。  \n脚本字段只能向返回的数据中添加内容，其计算结果无法用于查询（如需在查询中使用，请参阅运行时字段）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When using runtime fields, the calculated value can be used in the query itself.\nIn the following code this is used to run a query for a given gender and maximum age of persons:",
      "translation": "在使用运行时字段时，计算出的值可以直接用于查询本身。  \n在以下代码中，此功能被用来针对特定性别和最大年龄执行人员查询：",
      "count": 1
    },
