    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>define the <code>ScriptedField</code> that calculates the age of a person.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>when using a <code>Query</code>, add the scripted field to the query.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>when adding a scripted field to a <code>Query</code>, an additional source filter is needed to also retrieve the <em>normal</em> fields from the document source.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>get the data where the <code>Person</code> entities now have the values set in their <code>age</code> property.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>when using the repository, all that needs to be done is adding the scripted field as method parameter.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "1. 定义用于计算人员年龄的 `ScriptedField`。  \n2. 在使用 `Query` 时，将脚本字段添加到查询中。  \n3. 当向 `Query` 添加脚本字段时，需要额外的源过滤器以同时检索文档源中的普通字段。  \n4. 获取数据，此时 `Person` 实体在其 `age` 属性中已设置相应值。  \n5. 在使用存储库时，只需将脚本字段作为方法参数添加即可。",
      "count": 1
    },
